# Ignore Files

# Reverse-engineering working files. The Ghidra project regenerates from the
# local SOVIET64.exe in minutes, so it is not worth versioning.
ghidra/

# Build output. tesmiolauncher.exe, tesmioloader.dll and plugins\*.dll all land
# here, along with the live tesmioloader.ini the launcher writes.
build/

# The Python helpers docs/ refers to (tools/pe/*.py, tools/assets/*.py) and the
# signing key under tools/signing/. See docs/README.md on what is and is not in
# this repository.
tools/
tsmsign.obj

# Generated by the signing tool, and the half of the key pair that must never
# ship. A build without these compiles into a launcher that simply never
# mentions signatures - see the __has_include block in src/tesmiolauncher.cpp.
src/tesmio_pubkey.h
src/tesmio_sign.h

# Notes
идеи.txt
